    "title": "UPDATE: Minnesota Murder Suspect Arrested in Louisa County After Multi-County Chase - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jennifer Wilkerson ,\n1 days ago A Minnesota man wanted on murder charges was arrested after a multi-county pursuit that began in Washington County on Sunday afternoon. Officials arrested 45-year-old Randy Zimmerman of Courland, Minnesota, in Muscatine County. According to local officials, around 3 p.m. the Washington County Sheriff’s Office responded to information received of a wanted subject eastbound on Highway 92. The suspect’s vehicle was located after a License Plate Recognition System provided a hit in Washington County. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
